{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":8510720,"ns":0,"title":"Bus-holder","extract":"A bus-holder or bus-keeper is a weak latch circuit that holds the last value on a tri-state bus.\nThe circuit is basically a delay element with the output connected back to the input through a relatively high impedance.","description":"Weak latch circuit that holds the last value on a tri-state bus","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}